<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Welcome to Nyx Chat</title>
	<style>
		* { box-sizing: border-box; }

		body {
			min-height: 100vh;
			margin: 0;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			color: #edf2ff;
			background: #111827;
			font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
		}

		main {
			flex: 1;
			display: grid;
			place-items: center;
			padding: 48px 24px;
			text-align: center;
			background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #283c5c, #111827 70%);
		}

		.welcome { max-width: 680px; }

		.status {
			display: inline-block;
			margin-bottom: 22px;
			padding: 8px 14px;
			border: 1px solid #50678c;
			border-radius: 999px;
			color: #c4d6f5;
			font-size: 0.85rem;
			letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		}

		h1 {
			margin: 0 0 18px;
			font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 4.5rem);
			line-height: 1.1;
		}

		h1 span { color: #8ab4ff; }

		p {
			max-width: 540px;
			margin: 0 auto;
			color: #bec9da;
			font-size: 1.1rem;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		footer {
			padding: 20px 24px;
			border-top: 1px solid #29364b;
			color: #94a0b4;
			font-size: 0.9rem;
			text-align: center;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<main>
		<section class="welcome" aria-labelledby="welcome-heading">
			<span class="status">Currently in development</span>
			<h1 id="welcome-heading">Welcome to <span>Nyx Chat</span></h1>
			<p>We’re happy you’re here! Nyx Chat is a new project currently in progress. We’re building a welcoming place to connect, and we can’t wait to share more with you.</p>
		</section>
	</main>

	<footer>&copy; <span id="year">2026</span> Nyx Chat. Thanks for stopping by. Tame ZEED &#10084;&#65039;</footer>
	<script>
		document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
	</script>
</body>
</html>
